{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "febd3abc5b74394b05e9b9fbb3ad791e3c2a1c2203b16bb0a9241753cf16f2ea", "ja": "ロックフェスで弾けろ！", "zh": "嗨翻摇滚祭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e4de2402dafa0b480fa66f719418fbd4e06c469e4260cae4951cee3b236f359c", "ja": "ロックフェス当日。ジュリアに連れられ、\nライブをあちこち見て回るエミリー。周囲の\nファンの盛り上がりを見て、自身も次第に\n楽しくなってくる。自分を支えてくれる\nファン達の目線を知り、大いに感動する。", "zh": "艾蜜莉在摇滚祭当天，\n被茱莉亚拉着四处欣赏演唱会。\n看到周遭粉丝的热情，自己也渐渐乐于其中。\n体会到支持自己的粉丝是站在什么样的视角，\n让艾蜜莉大受感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "86403bbfd1789f6bb8f0c2f8e6cbf3ccf95bfdef0b87a7c9cf29b60f43480ee4", "ja": "Wow！　ここが反骨精神音楽祭の会場なんですね？\nあちらにもこちらにも、大勢の人が……！", "zh": "Wow！这里就是反骨精神音乐祭的会场吗？\n到处都人山人海……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "a9279a773ed3218b8705821fbbda2e59f622a29e3f5cc635e063f68ab0077ecc", "ja": "ここにいる方は、みなさん反骨精神を\n聴きにいらしたんですね。すごい熱気です！", "zh": "在场所有人，都是来听反骨精神的吧。\n气氛真的好热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "26233614425e1eb0bf32a4efa28af10250d7e20051734cb6f09088984fb952ad", "ja": "うん。さすが国内最大のロックフェスティバル、\n開場したばかりなのに大盛況だな。", "zh": "嗯，真不愧是国内规模最大的摇滚祭，\n才刚开场就看得到这种盛况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "666346d879231af34d6891d17e94971c42fdcc872a774bf5ff3c32817ddbabd9", "ja": "食べ物の屋台なんかもいっぱい……。\nなんだか、夏祭りみたいですね♪", "zh": "现场也有好多小吃摊贩……\n感觉就像夏日祭典一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "3939b67573c3f6adebd272bd14cff848f2a6be81cac8b88ec5833a7abcee405e", "ja": "はは、そりゃそうさ！\nロックフェスも、立派な祭りのひとつだからな。", "zh": "哈哈，那是当然的！\n毕竟摇滚祭也是一种祭典啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "b800814b924f1bef92d133ad7941f087a0f162fcc96eac79dfa23b33481c8c50", "ja": "お祭りといえば、まつりなのです。\nわんだほー！にお祭りを楽しむのです！", "zh": "说到祭典，就是茉莉的代名词喔。\n要尽情享受美妙祭典的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "1465f5208b69af9f68611d4738320b2b70d6d2235841546fb16f198109553d3b", "ja": "屋台だけじゃなくて、ステージもいくつかあるだろ？\n同じ時間に、いろんなバンドがライブをやってるんだ。", "zh": "不只摊贩很多，你们应该也有发现舞台有好几个吧？\n这是因为同一时间会有不同乐团在办演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ad3bf797afe7389371be29abd6320c450b304ea09c69c1b6ed4189ff3506c0e", "ja": "で、自分が気になったバンドを、好きなように\n見に行く。それがこのフェスの楽しみ方さ♪", "zh": "观众可以随意去看自己喜欢的乐团表演，\n这就是享受这场摇滚祭的方式♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45f16fb3d241ae597ddf935b17c87a4d7b4416f0015a8be23bf034a6610db832", "ja": "へ～、フェスってそんなふうに楽しむんだ……。\nふふっ、まるで音楽の展覧会だね♪", "zh": "哦～原来在摇滚祭要这样玩啊……\n呵呵，就像一场音乐博览会呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ab511d05318378fb12785128033efb8566e781b814910fb0f29a5473c1441b37", "ja": "けど、どうしようかな。\n私、ロックにはあんまり詳しくなくて……。", "zh": "不过该怎么办呢，\n我对摇滚不太熟悉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "bc33b562817289d2a315b57d372084b0b28825d5c59e9193a5a8364c449a919e", "ja": "風花さん。よかったら、一緒に見て回りませんか。\n前から気になっていたバンドが出演するそうなので。", "zh": "那样的话，风花姊要不要和我一起逛？\n我之前就在关注的乐团听说会登台表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "bfab2ee04d0b5ccf1cc0d3910b4b8dad8ce90f88006d09ce9c281dc2997b1bf8", "ja": "姫も、千早ちゃんと風花ちゃんと一緒に行くのです。\nぱわほー！に盛り上がっていきましょー。", "zh": "公主也要和小千早跟小风花一起去的喔。\n一起去强大地嗨起来吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "12714e7340d421529880597a46e759806483887d19e972af0093c6c95d155b4f", "ja": "おう、行ってきな。\nフェス、思いっきり楽しんでこいよ！", "zh": "好，你们去吧。\n一定要尽情享受这场摇滚祭喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "11f8051746b1cf0eea869bd7e572a86428e64102b418fb60fada8c6c4b612fe8", "ja": "あれ？\nジュリアは、千早達と一緒に行かないのか？", "zh": "咦？\n茱莉亚，你不跟千早她们一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "2d2b408a652fe864f76913bc5257ce4f5579bd81bc41934abf2584a857b7c67d", "ja": "ん？　ああ。あたしはこの後、\n目当てのバンドがライブやるんだ。", "zh": "嗯？\n是啊，因为待会我关注的乐团有演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "ea2d08e9916b11182c144b473f8bee2f91ccaa029a993412848692e5abbb25b7", "ja": "今日のフェスは、このバンドが見たくて来たような\nものだからな！　{$P$}も行くか？", "zh": "今天的摇滚祭，我可以说是为了看这个乐团才来的！\n{$P$}也要来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "548b7b7a6b075b4cd4aba45ca3bb46f7fa0106153bab3a363c039604b7c2c86b", "ja": "ジュリアのおススメか。なら、俺も見学しようかな。\nエミリーはどうする？", "zh": "茱莉亚推荐的乐团啊，那我也去观摩看看好了。\n艾蜜莉你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "61cbb4fde88f471fe7f0a81884191608e76f378540b04e232f9f1e3f08ab31ed", "ja": "は、はい！　あの、私も\nジュリアさんと一緒にいってもいいですか？", "zh": "我、我吗！\n请问，我也可以跟茱莉亚一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "794baeb9f82b35f3fbda001cddfcd4502eb5dc4391e62b10128ac9decb07bc17", "ja": "そりゃ、別にかまわないけど……。\nいいのか？　あたしの個人的な趣味で。", "zh": "要跟来无所谓……\n但这纯属我个人的喜好，没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "04ac17e55b1e36ccf6b78cd7dbf59d9471a8ed9fa3aaeb12efbe296af5ba31fd", "ja": "はい！　私、今日は反骨精神について学びたくて……\nジュリアさん、私に反骨精神を教えてください！", "zh": "没关系！我希望今天能够学习到反骨精神……\n茱莉亚，请你教教我反骨精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "d910dd9fc76ffc1069d00037b0b1ac2f2767d7ca713ccf08c3c84c780bb20966", "ja": "反骨精神、なあ……。その言い方も面白いけど、\n「ロック」のほうが短くて簡単じゃないか？", "zh": "反骨精神吗……那种说法也很有趣啦，\n但讲「摇滚」不是比较短也比较简单吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "e217d7bd70b086b47267f1904bcb7c9a23a915daa779385942d8b6988f79a4d2", "ja": "いえ、長くても、難しくてもいいんです。\n反骨精神は、反骨精神と呼ばなくては！", "zh": "不，就算冗长又难懂也没关系。\n反骨精神，就该称作反骨精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "68ca4e7537fcfc1d93f7d24dadebe0a11a5a6e65cc3fb880eb57e6e4ca7c60c9", "ja": "ははっ、了解！\nエミリーって、なんかロックなところあるよな。", "zh": "哈哈，了解！\n艾蜜莉，你的想法也有点摇滚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "02170c23cd6a2e6aa1516cdd4ae1eeb6694a8b7ff6a52e784e1c5edfa9b39faa", "ja": "えっ？\n私に、反骨精神なところ……ですか？", "zh": "咦？\n我有反骨精神……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "2afa726952163023fbce8e7dbd5e77ee5e00c59c4d2251d0ca886ba0d0ee287c", "ja": "ああ。……おっと、そろそろ始まる時間だな。\nそれじゃ2人とも、あたしについてきな！", "zh": "是啊……糟糕，差不多要开始了。\n那么你们两个，跟着我来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "d74727e3a917bb2958ccac099bc141b9866d367a869ca2ae0901b15a3945e1f5", "ja": "はい！\n仕掛け人さま、私と共に反骨精神を学びましょう♪", "zh": "好！\n策划执行人先生，我们一起来学习反骨精神吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "15d0744398db3bbeac642e35647bfc27ac37c9ff294d0a314f33166eb5e8f856", "ja": "ジュリア。あの正面のステージ、特に人が\n集まってるみたいだな。有名なバンドなのか？", "zh": "茱莉亚，那个正面的舞台好像聚集了特别多人。\n是有名的乐团在表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "6dfe37afef78d1ed41eb496bb2f30f862abb9a4bf86fafe58cc89cd6e7412f8f", "ja": "ああ、あそこはいわゆるメインステージだよ。\nメインアクトだけが、あそこに立てるのさ。", "zh": "对，那是所谓的主舞台，\n只有主要表演者能站上那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "a47996f09a8d3129fe8dfb64062c38e0d20c609e47f78802f626d2f68dc406dc", "ja": "このフェスに出てるバンドにとっては、\nあそこが聖地みたいなものだな。", "zh": "对于参加这场摇滚祭的乐团来说，\n那里就像是圣地一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "11cefb5776459228a44fad917fd220efdef16a1958b5a262b2d2fc3aab797ac7", "ja": "聖地……ではみなさん、あの舞台を目指して\n切磋琢磨しているのですね……。", "zh": "圣地……所以大家都是以那座舞台为目标，\n彼此切磋琢磨对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "d19ae34cec87b4e2478068a4072d4355bb25241e9f982d67dd3125f165e74ef9", "ja": "そうだな。昔はあたしも、\n「いつかあのステージに立ちたい」って思ってた。", "zh": "是啊。以前我也曾经梦想过，\n「总有一天要站上那座舞台」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "c158fa5e00a1ffa9912b53bf49f87b78a3e42198f7acd17ca41ae63575e8a96e", "ja": "今は、立ちたいと思っていないのか？", "zh": "现在你不想站上去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "1ab772341b7a791d10e23a8cdfe2229d16e2d639fd8594087f896892242e2072", "ja": "いや。……けど、そうだな。\n立つとしたら、今のあたしじゃない気がする。", "zh": "想啊……不过，该怎么说呢。\n现在的我可能还不够格站上去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "88f35537de106e3ca3f8c015c378f1454926a36de1f05bebb0f4f8b3d38fb227", "ja": "あそこに立つには、まだまだ実力が足りない。\nアイドルとしても、ボーカリストとしてもな。", "zh": "想站上那里，我的实力还差得远了。\n不只在偶像方面，在歌手方面也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "0b75335daf20b73ff6c8b2252f4296349a09b87739e6153dfe6832b67ce3a68a", "ja": "ジュリアさん……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "8fe0b1dc9d5d68a8bc3962f9a4e809d5360042aff33865eeb43c31553afbd086", "ja": "はは、なんだかしんみりしちまったな。\n気分変えて、ウチらもステージ前に行くぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，好像突然感伤起来了呢。\n转换一下心情，我们也去舞台前吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "76a5edc5719ed7e3a36ce9bf3f587c6e659062d7b24ab9aa8166f3f5c71bba24", "ja": "エミリー、{$P$}！\nふたりとも、あたしからはぐれるなよ♪", "zh": "艾蜜莉、{$P$}！\n你们可别跟我走散了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1037_audience", "source_sha256": "f480fd8bcdd2b40dcda779961637e6b74f9888615c9a35327d379b17c88ae489", "ja": "（ワアアアァァァァー！）", "zh": "（哗啊啊啊啊啊啊啊──！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "0f82fe624a1f5a04d891e22ce7d8c0fd75dac700d470933aa4e14fae2f226ade", "ja": "さ、さすがにすごい人だな……！\nジュリア、エミリー、大丈夫か？", "zh": "人、人真的好多啊……！\n茱莉亚、艾蜜莉，你们还可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1039_032emi", "source_sha256": "f3d8f9b26d5fd6d549fa668f9391d1e15babaa5bf9bf678016503b2f9f5c050c", "ja": "は、はい！　ジュリアさんは……。", "zh": "我、我没事！茱莉亚你呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1040_bandman", "source_sha256": "357390f529be511d2a709c8dfcb0636c8658d0ddd5b8bc4a79369c27c9f8a88e", "ja": "グリーンエリアステージへようこそー！\nお前ら、思いっきり盛り上がって行くぞー！", "zh": "欢迎来到绿区的舞台──！\n大家，让我们嗨翻天吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "3a9efb4ab70cf73172d580daeee0edf0ed5e28d47fa1773faccbf68be81c95f5", "ja": "イェーイ！！　……ははっ、やっぱライブはいいね！\nサイコーだよ♪", "zh": "耶～！！……哈哈，果然演唱会就是棒！\n真是棒透了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "a1cc0f7b7053d34ee5c946c525d2c5d5ba595f1056b51f3480fec57a2655aaff", "ja": "うん、全然大丈夫みたいだな！", "zh": "嗯，看来完全不用担心她了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "667d394457b3ae6ad46a89e1c3706e4f2cf5121c4d5119e5e4433ed55a47aa57", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね！　人が大勢で、おしくら\nまんじゅうみたいで、驚いてしまいましたが……。", "zh": "呵呵，就是说啊！\n虽然人多到好像在玩你推我挤的游戏，让我吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "5f9908739e250607788ce6400bc65ab97bcc58e00657bd5e3f8d5aef3ced6f75", "ja": "みなさんすごい盛り上がりです！\n私もなんだか、楽しくなってきて……ふふふふっ♪", "zh": "但大家都好热情！\n我也跟着开心起来了……呵呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1045_bandman", "source_sha256": "10bac5a75e87a544b79eedea88b3ddec7373d46fcccfc342eb793b75278f3ee4", "ja": "それじゃ、次の曲だ！\nお前ら、準備はできてるかー！！", "zh": "接着是下一首歌！\n你们准备好了吗──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "eab264c304b169e26e0617ef62f602c9ed2c7d280dd7714863890eaa1871f115", "ja": "イェーイ！　ほら、エミリー！\n{$P$}も！", "zh": "耶～！快呀，艾蜜莉！{$P$}！\n你们也一起来啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "9e3840c2a0510d90abf260d2e5330e2f5bd262c7e6e43c01c921732bd575ab24", "ja": "わ、私もですか！？　けど、そんなに\n大きな声を出したら、はしたないのでは……。", "zh": "我，我也要吗！？\n可是那样大叫，不会很不得体吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "38af22de8a8bbe22cc0a49edc14b94ab1c6c78586ddf9a4d9217d2f20cd7ae95", "ja": "何言ってるんだよ、ライブなんだから大きな声を出す\nのは当たり前だろ？　盛り上がるのが礼儀ってモンだ♪", "zh": "你在说什么啊，在演唱会上呐喊不是理所当然的吗？\n跟着嗨才合乎礼仪啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "890b18fab7ef01a019df11a1a7b75030f681c9b220d3de70382e85de92c0530c", "ja": "れ、礼儀……！　わかりました！\nそれでは……い、イェーイ！", "zh": "礼、礼仪……！我知道了！\n那么……耶、耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2c1584764a64ff3cf031ef11dec871f1c18dfe18cae48d2a5a0f099e56bc9c9", "ja": "ははっ、いいね！　そう来なくっちゃな♪\nガンガン盛り上がっていくぜ！", "zh": "哈哈，很棒喔！就是要这样♪\n嗨到最高点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1051_032emi", "source_sha256": "1d8d4942484648231dc2102efc44102252fa184edc0d934d90de1a60590fc0c7", "ja": "イェーイ！！！", "zh": "耶～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1052_p", "source_sha256": "1d8d4942484648231dc2102efc44102252fa184edc0d934d90de1a60590fc0c7", "ja": "イェーイ！！！", "zh": "耶～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1053_050jul", "source_sha256": "920cd7760ef6561973e5a640276b28c2662205a2a2fa5ac852413914ff6d1c98", "ja": "あー、楽しかった！\nやっぱライブは盛り上がると気持ちいいな♪", "zh": "啊～好开心！\n果然嗨翻演唱会就是痛快♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1054_032emi", "source_sha256": "20cb1c2eb8a4f93e91be7ead49e51c4f32f3a29a1c110d3159d3317f1a60f9e9", "ja": "お、思わずたくさん叫んでしまいましたが……\n大和撫子として、はしたなくなかったでしょうか……？", "zh": "我、我刚才忍不住一直大喊……\n这样作为一个大和抚子，不会很不得体吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "d322e3def1a2be4cc8a48bca848dc2ba8c436d755c86400d163d2d59cb390f5e", "ja": "まさか。エミリーはバンドのコールに応えたんだ。\nむしろロック的には礼儀正しいコトをしたんだって！", "zh": "才不会呢，艾蜜莉回应了乐团的Call，\n这种行为反倒合乎摇滚礼仪啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1056_050jul", "source_sha256": "7ee9458fbe7b768c4dc4940ca4e8397df1ebe64b1485aa804b5cd926fbc9426a", "ja": "な、{$P$}。\n{$P$}もそう思うだろ？", "zh": "你说对吧，{$P$}。\n{$P$}也这么认为吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1057_p", "source_sha256": "d8a53a13a5717c81c1abe9905727ad548a0d02a727689069d2de109fdc5c0d7b", "ja": "そうだな。劇場に来てくれるファンの人達だって、\n大きな声で応援してくれる。それと同じじゃないかな。", "zh": "对啊，莅临剧场的粉丝们也会大声帮你们加油，\n这两者应该是一样的意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1058_032emi", "source_sha256": "f331215dcdc1ffec76b77998209b3bcff1651a2272e3e4915b4a8cf30cb9b094", "ja": "あっ……たしかに、そうですね。反骨精神の舞台、\n初めての体験だと思っていましたが……。", "zh": "啊……确实是这样没错呢。\n我本以为反骨精神的舞台是我从未经历的体验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "def3f01226dc1ed12436bd64490b3bd6c331d9f7c5c89144be843c1b10f88723", "ja": "ごヒイキ様方は、いつもこんな気持ちで\n私達の舞台を楽しんでいてくださったのですね……。", "zh": "但原来主顾们一直以来就是抱着这样的心情，\n在享受我们的表演啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1060_032emi", "source_sha256": "58a04e45437164f08951359c8a6a42684343cd1609797af6811bcb9e5531e123", "ja": "私、反骨精神音楽祭に参加できてよかったです。\nジュリアさん、ご指南ありがとうございました♪", "zh": "我很庆幸有来参加反骨精神音乐祭。\n茱莉亚，谢谢你的指导♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1061_050jul", "source_sha256": "746fe7876bdb895708097a3ee1b93035b4243bd3a368734ab70e04c56d166ffb", "ja": "おっと、エミリー。フェスはまだ終わってないんだ、\n感謝するのはまだ早いぜ？", "zh": "哎呀，艾蜜莉，\n摇滚祭还没结束，要感谢还太早啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1062_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ed5895c0565965cd3293006f6fb264962f0ac4033efe85e72418dac810645f3", "ja": "最後の最後まで、しっかり楽しまないとな。\nほら、次はあっちのステージだ！　行こうぜ！", "zh": "要好好享受到最后一刻才行啊。\n来吧，再来是那边的舞台！我们走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1063_032emi", "source_sha256": "4d2d97f4450a94cd864cb4d85cb014228ffd5f517463da5277cfb764aaf3cd47", "ja": "はいっ！　仕掛け人さま、\n仕掛け人さまも一緒に参りましょう♪", "zh": "好的！策划执行人先生，\n策划执行人先生也一起来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_02_1064_p", "source_sha256": "8a1a13edfc6cb0cd79bc4a23e92d71d59f51ccf0c6ee05d33861e06a9a870d24", "ja": "（ジュリアもエミリーも、それぞれ得るものが\nあったようだ。ロックフェス、いい経験になったな！）", "zh": "（看来茱莉亚和艾蜜莉都各有斩获。\n这次来参加摇滚祭成了很好的经验！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
